---
// 《深林》— 第一人称森林漫步。光影与细节优先，零素材全程序生成。
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base
  title="深林 · 玩具展馆"
  description="第一人称走进一座程序生成的森林：河与瀑布、三种树木、四万株摇曳的草、萤火与蝴蝶。光影随晨暮流转，发现五处秘境。WASD 或双摇杆漫步。"
>
  <script is:inline>
    document.documentElement.dataset.theme = 'dark';
  </script>

  <div class="void">
    <canvas id="stage" aria-label="深林 — 三维森林"></canvas>

    <div class="hud" id="hud">
      <a class="hud__back" href="/">← <span>大厅</span></a>

      <div class="hud__title shown">
        <span class="hud__no">展品 之 二十八</span>
        <h1>深林<span class="hud__seal" aria-hidden="true"></span></h1>
        <span class="hud__en">W A L K &nbsp; I N &nbsp; T H E &nbsp; D E E P &nbsp; W O O D S</span>
      </div>

      <div class="menuwrap">
        <button class="hud__fold-btn right" id="btn-menu" aria-expanded="false" title="功能菜单">☰ 菜单</button>
        <div class="hud__menu" id="menu">
          <button class="hud__btn" id="btn-photo" title="拍照：导出带位置水印的 PNG（P 键）">拍照</button>
          <button class="hud__btn" id="btn-beauty" aria-pressed="false" title="画面调节：时段 / 光效 / 草木">画面调节</button>
          <button class="hud__btn" id="btn-sound" aria-pressed="false" title="环境音：风声、水声、鸟鸣与虫声">声音 · 关</button>
          <button class="hud__btn" id="btn-cinema" aria-pressed="false" title="壁纸模式：隐藏全部界面（H 键）">壁纸</button>
          <button class="hud__btn" id="btn-full" title="全屏">全屏</button>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="beauty" id="beauty" hidden>
        <p class="beauty__tune">光</p>
        <label class="beauty__row"><span>时段</span><input type="range" id="be-day" min="0" max="1" step="0.01" value="0.55"><b>金午后</b></label>
        <label class="beauty__row"><span>辉光</span><input type="range" id="be-bloom" min="0" max="1.6" step="0.05" value="1"><b>1.00×</b></label>
        <p class="beauty__tune">草木</p>
        <label class="beauty__row"><span>风力</span><input type="range" id="be-wind" min="0" max="2.5" step="0.1" value="1"><b>1.0×</b></label>
        <label class="beauty__row"><span>草密</span><input type="range" id="be-grass" min="0" max="1" step="0.05" value="1"><b>1.00×</b></label>
        <label class="beauty__row"><span>萤火</span><input type="range" id="be-firefly" min="0" max="1" step="0.05" value="1"><b>1.00×</b></label>
      </div>

      <div class="hud__clock">
        <span class="hud__day" id="hud-day">金午后</span>
        <span class="hud__near" id="hud-near"></span>
      </div>

      <div class="hud__score" id="hud-score"></div>

      <div class="hud__hint shown" id="hud-hint">
        <b>WASD</b> 行走 · <b>鼠标</b> 环顾 · <b>Shift</b> 奔跑 · <b>空格</b> 跳 · <b>H</b> 壁纸 · 点击画面锁定鼠标
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- 发现 -->
    <div class="discovery" id="discovery" hidden>
      <span class="discovery__tag">发现</span>
      <b id="discovery-name"></b>
      <p id="discovery-line"></p>
    </div>

    <div class="speed-toast" id="speed-toast"></div>

    <div class="veil" id="veil">
      <div class="veil__orbit"><i></i></div>
      <p class="veil__text">正在种下一片森林…</p>
    </div>

    <div class="fatal" id="fatal" hidden>
      <p>森林没能生长出来。</p>
      <p class="muted small" id="fatal-msg"></p>
      <a class="hud__btn" href="/">← 回到大厅</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</Base>

<style is:global>
  :root {
    --ink: #e8ecf4;
    --red: #e8384f;
    --radius-m: 14px;
    --radius-s: 8px;
    --ease: cubic-bezier(0.22, 0.61, 0.36, 1);
    --font-serif: 'Noto Serif SC', Georgia, serif;
    --font-mono: 'SF Mono', Menlo, Consolas, monospace;
  }
  * { box-sizing: border-box; }
  html, body { margin: 0; height: 100%; overflow: hidden; background: #0a0d10; }
  .void { position: fixed; inset: 0; }
  #stage { position: absolute; inset: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%; display: block; touch-action: none; cursor: crosshair; }

  .hud { position: absolute; inset: 0; pointer-events: none; z-index: 10; }
  .hud::before {
    content: ''; position: absolute; inset: 0; z-index: -1; pointer-events: none;
    background: radial-gradient(120% 90% at 50% 8%, transparent 62%, rgba(4, 6, 8, 0.42));
  }
  .hud__back {
    position: absolute; top: 18px; left: 20px; z-index: 11;
    color: rgba(232, 236, 244, 0.78); text-decoration: none;
    font-family: var(--font-serif); font-size: 0.86rem; letter-spacing: 0.24em;
    text-shadow: 0 1px 3px rgba(0,0,0,0.9); pointer-events: auto;
  }
  .hud__back:hover { color: #ffd9a0; }
  .hud__title { position: absolute; top: 20px; left: 50%; transform: translate(-50%, 0); text-align: center; }
  .hud__no { font-size: 0.62rem; letter-spacing: 0.5em; color: rgba(232, 236, 244, 0.5); }
  .hud__title h1 {
    margin: 5px 0 3px; font-family: var(--font-serif); font-weight: 700;
    font-size: clamp(1.3rem, 3.2vw, 1.9rem); letter-spacing: 0.3em; text-indent: 0.3em;
    color: #f4f7fc; text-shadow: 0 1px 3px rgba(0,0,0,1), 0 0 24px rgba(0,0,0,0.85);
  }
  .hud__seal {
    display: inline-block; width: 0.55em; height: 0.55em; margin-left: 0.5em;
    background: #ff2440; border-radius: 50%; vertical-align: 0.2em;
    box-shadow: 0 0 12px rgba(255, 36, 64, 0.9);
  }
  .hud__en { font-size: 0.54rem; letter-spacing: 0.3em; color: rgba(232, 236, 244, 0.38); }

  .hud__fold-btn {
    background: rgba(8, 10, 18, 0.55); color: rgba(232, 236, 244, 0.9);
    border: 1px solid rgba(232, 236, 244, 0.24); border-radius: 999px;
    padding: 7px 16px; font-size: 0.84rem; letter-spacing: 0.14em;
    backdrop-filter: blur(8px); cursor: pointer; transition: all 0.2s;
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
  }
  .hud__fold-btn:hover { border-color: rgba(232, 56, 79, 0.7); color: #fff; }
  .hud__fold-btn[aria-expanded='true'] { border-color: var(--red); color: #ff8a97; }
  .menuwrap { position: absolute; top: 18px; right: 20px; pointer-events: auto; z-index: 13; }
  .hud__menu {
    position: absolute; top: 46px; right: 0; width: 148px;
    display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 5px; padding: 10px;
    background: rgba(8, 10, 18, 0.78); border: 1px solid rgba(232, 236, 244, 0.16);
    border-radius: var(--radius-m); backdrop-filter: blur(14px);
    transform: scale(0.92); transform-origin: top right;
    opacity: 0; pointer-events: none;
    transition: transform 0.18s var(--ease), opacity 0.18s var(--ease);
  }
  .hud__menu.open { transform: scale(1); opacity: 1; pointer-events: auto; }
  .hud__btn {
    background: transparent; color: rgba(232, 236, 244, 0.85);
    border: 1px solid rgba(232, 236, 244, 0.2); border-radius: var(--radius-s);
    padding: 7px 10px; font-size: 0.8rem; letter-spacing: 0.08em; width: 100%;
    text-align: left; cursor: pointer; transition: all 0.2s; text-decoration: none;
  }
  .hud__menu .hud__btn:hover { border-color: rgba(232, 56, 79, 0.7); color: #fff; }
  .hud__btn[aria-pressed='true'] { border-color: var(--red); color: #ff8a97; }

  .beauty {
    position: absolute; top: 58px; right: 0; z-index: 14;
    width: 216px; padding: 14px 16px 10px;
    background: rgba(8, 10, 18, 0.74); border: 1px solid rgba(232, 236, 244, 0.14);
    border-radius: 14px; backdrop-filter: blur(14px); pointer-events: auto;
  }
  .beauty[hidden] { display: none; }
  .beauty__tune { margin: 4px 0 8px; font-size: 0.62rem; letter-spacing: 0.42em; color: rgba(255, 217, 160, 0.72); }
  .beauty__row { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; margin-bottom: 9px; font-size: 0.78rem; color: rgba(232, 236, 244, 0.82); }
  .beauty__row span { flex: 0 0 52px; }
  .beauty__row b {
    flex: 0 0 52px; text-align: right; font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 0.68rem; font-weight: 400;
    color: rgba(255, 217, 160, 0.9); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
  }
  .beauty__row input[type='range'] {
    flex: 1; height: 3px; appearance: none; -webkit-appearance: none;
    background: linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(255, 200, 120, 0.5), rgba(232, 236, 244, 0.18));
    border-radius: 2px; outline: none; cursor: pointer;
  }
  .beauty__row input[type='range']::-webkit-slider-thumb {
    appearance: none; -webkit-appearance: none; width: 12px; height: 12px; border-radius: 50%;
    background: #ffd9a0; border: 1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.4); box-shadow: 0 0 8px rgba(255, 200, 120, 0.6);
  }

  .hud__clock {
    position: absolute; left: 20px; bottom: 18px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 2px;
    font-family: var(--font-mono); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
  }
  .hud__day { font-size: 1.05rem; color: #f0e8d8; text-shadow: 0 1px 3px rgba(0,0,0,0.9); }
  .hud__near { font-size: 0.72rem; color: rgba(232, 236, 244, 0.62); }
  .hud__near b { color: #ffd9a0; font-weight: 600; }
  .hud__score {
    position: absolute; left: 50%; bottom: 18px; transform: translateX(-50%);
    font-size: 0.74rem; letter-spacing: 0.2em; color: rgba(232, 236, 244, 0.55);
  }
  .hud__score b { color: #ffd9a0; }
  .hud__hint {
    position: absolute; left: 50%; bottom: 44px; transform: translateX(-50%);
    font-size: 0.72rem; letter-spacing: 0.12em; color: rgba(232, 236, 244, 0.6);
    text-shadow: 0 1px 3px rgba(0,0,0,0.9); white-space: nowrap;
    opacity: 0; transition: opacity 1.2s var(--ease);
  }
  .hud__hint.shown { opacity: 1; }
  .hud__hint.fade { opacity: 0; }
  .hud__hint b { color: #ffd9a0; font-weight: 600; }

  .discovery {
    position: absolute; left: 50%; top: 20%; transform: translateX(-50%);
    background: rgba(8, 10, 18, 0.88); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 200, 120, 0.5);
    border-radius: var(--radius-m); padding: 16px 22px; z-index: 20;
    max-width: min(420px, 88vw); text-align: center;
    animation: disc-in 0.5s var(--ease);
  }
  .discovery[hidden] { display: none; }
  .discovery__tag {
    display: inline-block; font-size: 0.62rem; letter-spacing: 0.5em; color: #ffd9a0;
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 200, 120, 0.5); border-radius: 999px; padding: 2px 12px 2px 16px; margin-bottom: 8px;
  }
  .discovery b { display: block; font-family: var(--font-serif); font-size: 1.15rem; letter-spacing: 0.24em; color: #ffe9c4; margin-bottom: 6px; }
  .discovery p { margin: 0; font-size: 0.8rem; line-height: 1.7; color: rgba(232, 236, 244, 0.78); }
  @keyframes disc-in { from { opacity: 0; transform: translate(-50%, -8px); } to { opacity: 1; transform: translate(-50%, 0); } }

  .speed-toast {
    position: absolute; left: 50%; bottom: 76px; transform: translate(-50%, 6px);
    padding: 6px 16px; border-radius: 999px; z-index: 18;
    background: rgba(8, 10, 18, 0.72); border: 1px solid rgba(232, 236, 244, 0.18);
    font-size: 0.78rem; color: rgba(232, 236, 244, 0.88);
    opacity: 0; transition: all 0.25s var(--ease); pointer-events: none;
  }
  .speed-toast.show { opacity: 1; transform: translate(-50%, 0); }

  .veil {
    position: absolute; inset: 0; z-index: 50; display: flex; flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: 14px;
    background: #070a0c; transition: opacity 1.4s var(--ease);
  }
  .veil.lit { opacity: 0; pointer-events: none; }
  .veil__orbit { width: 64px; height: 64px; border: 1px solid rgba(232, 236, 244, 0.22); border-radius: 50%; position: relative; }
  .veil__orbit i {
    position: absolute; top: 50%; left: 50%; width: 6px; height: 6px; border-radius: 50%;
    background: #6fbf73; box-shadow: 0 0 12px #6fbf73;
    animation: orbit 2.4s linear infinite;
  }
  @keyframes orbit { from { transform: rotate(0) translateX(28px); } to { transform: rotate(360deg) translateX(28px); } }
  .veil__text { margin: 0; font-size: 0.85rem; letter-spacing: 0.4em; color: rgba(232, 236, 244, 0.5); }

  .fatal {
    position: absolute; inset: 0; z-index: 60; display: flex; flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: 8px;
    background: #04060a; text-align: center; padding: 24px;
  }
  .fatal[hidden] { display: none; }
  .fatal p { margin: 0; font-family: var(--font-serif); }

  #forest-stick {
    position: fixed; width: 96px; height: 96px; border-radius: 50%;
    border: 1.5px solid rgba(255, 210, 140, 0.38); background: rgba(10, 14, 26, 0.25);
    transform: translate(-50%, -50%); z-index: 12; pointer-events: none; display: none;
  }
  #forest-stick .knob {
    position: absolute; left: 50%; top: 50%; width: 40px; height: 40px; border-radius: 50%;
    background: rgba(255, 224, 178, 0.16); border: 1.5px solid rgba(255, 216, 150, 0.5);
    transform: translate(-50%, -50%);
  }
  #forest-stick.look { border-color: rgba(120, 210, 255, 0.42); }
  #forest-stick.look .knob { background: rgba(178, 228, 255, 0.14); border-color: rgba(140, 214, 255, 0.55); }

  body.cinema .hud, body.cinema .discovery, body.cinema .speed-toast, body.cinema #forest-stick { display: none !important; }

  @media (max-width: 560px) {
    .hud__title h1 { letter-spacing: 0.2em; }
    .hud__hint { font-size: 0.64rem; bottom: 74px; }
    .hud__score { bottom: 30px; }
    .hud__clock { bottom: 52px; }
    .hud__fold-btn { padding: 6px 12px; font-size: 0.76rem; }
    .hud__menu { width: 136px; }
    .beauty { width: 196px; }
  }
</style>

<script>
  import { createForest, type ForestTick, type ForestBeauty } from '../../scripts/forest-scene';
  import { ForestAudio } from '../../scripts/forest-audio';
  import { dayLabel } from '../../scripts/forest-core';

  const canvas = document.getElementById('stage') as HTMLCanvasElement;
  const veil = document.getElementById('veil')!;
  const fatal = document.getElementById('fatal')!;
  const fatalMsg = document.getElementById('fatal-msg')!;
  const hudDay = document.getElementById('hud-day')!;
  const hudNear = document.getElementById('hud-near')!;
  const hudScore = document.getElementById('hud-score')!;
  const hudHint = document.getElementById('hud-hint')!;
  const discovery = document.getElementById('discovery')!;
  const discoveryName = document.getElementById('discovery-name')!;
  const discoveryLine = document.getElementById('discovery-line')!;
  const speedToast = document.getElementById('speed-toast')!;
  const coarse = matchMedia('(pointer: coarse)').matches;

  function die(msg: string) {
    fatal.hidden = false;
    fatalMsg.textContent = msg;
    document.title = `✗ ${msg || '未知错误'} · 深林`;
    veil.classList.add('lit');
  }
  let toastTimer: ReturnType<typeof setTimeout> | undefined;
  function showToast(text: string) {
    speedToast.textContent = text;
    speedToast.classList.add('show');
    if (toastTimer) clearTimeout(toastTimer);
    toastTimer = setTimeout(() => speedToast.classList.remove('show'), 1600);
  }

  // ---- 菜单 / 面板 ----
  const btnMenu = document.getElementById('btn-menu') as HTMLButtonElement;
  const menuEl = document.getElementById('menu')!;
  const beautyPanel = document.getElementById('beauty')!;
  const btnBeauty = document.getElementById('btn-beauty') as HTMLButtonElement;
  const btnSound = document.getElementById('btn-sound') as HTMLButtonElement;
  const btnCinema = document.getElementById('btn-cinema') as HTMLButtonElement;
  const btnPhoto = document.getElementById('btn-photo') as HTMLButtonElement;
  const btnFull = document.getElementById('btn-full') as HTMLButtonElement;
  function closeMenu() {
    menuEl.classList.remove('open');
    btnMenu.setAttribute('aria-expanded', 'false');
  }
  btnMenu.addEventListener('click', () => {
    const open = menuEl.classList.toggle('open');
    btnMenu.setAttribute('aria-expanded', String(open));
    if (open) { beautyPanel.hidden = true; btnBeauty.setAttribute('aria-pressed', 'false'); }
  });
  btnBeauty.addEventListener('click', () => {
    const show = beautyPanel.hidden;
    beautyPanel.hidden = !show;
    btnBeauty.setAttribute('aria-pressed', String(show));
    if (show) closeMenu();
  });

  // ---- 壁纸模式 ----
  function toggleCinema() {
    const on = !document.body.classList.contains('cinema');
    document.body.classList.toggle('cinema', on);
    btnCinema.setAttribute('aria-pressed', String(on));
    btnCinema.textContent = on ? '壁纸 · 开' : '壁纸';
  }
  btnCinema.textContent = '壁纸';
  btnCinema.addEventListener('click', toggleCinema);
  if (new URLSearchParams(location.search).has('cinema')) setTimeout(toggleCinema, 100);
  addEventListener('keydown', (e) => {
    if (e.key.toLowerCase() === 'h' && !(e.target as HTMLElement)?.closest('button, a, input, textarea')) toggleCinema();
  });
  btnFull.addEventListener('click', () => {
    if (document.fullscreenElement) void document.exitFullscreen();
    else void document.documentElement.requestFullscreen().catch(() => {});
  });

  // ---- 环境音 ----
  const audio = new ForestAudio();
  btnSound.addEventListener('click', () => {
    const on = audio.toggle();
    btnSound.textContent = on ? '声音 · 开' : '声音 · 关';
    btnSound.setAttribute('aria-pressed', String(on));
  });

  // ---- 画面调节（持久化） ----
  const BEAUTY_STORE = 'opt-forest-beauty';
  const beautyState: ForestBeauty = { day: 0.55, bloom: 1, wind: 1, grass: 1, firefly: 1 };
  const sliderMap: [string, keyof ForestBeauty, 'num' | 'day'][] = [
    ['be-day', 'day', 'day'], ['be-bloom', 'bloom', 'num'], ['be-wind', 'wind', 'num'],
    ['be-grass', 'grass', 'num'], ['be-firefly', 'firefly', 'num'],
  ];
  function saveBeauty() {
    try { localStorage.setItem(BEAUTY_STORE, JSON.stringify(beautyState)); } catch { /* 私隐 */ }
  }
  function readoutFor(key: keyof ForestBeauty): string {
    return key === 'day' ? dayLabel(beautyState.day) : key === 'wind' ? `${beautyState.wind.toFixed(1)}×` : `${(beautyState[key] as number).toFixed(2)}×`;
  }
  for (const [id, key, kind] of sliderMap) {
    const input = document.getElementById(id) as HTMLInputElement;
    const readout = input.parentElement!.querySelector('b')!;
    input.addEventListener('input', () => {
      beautyState[key] = Number(input.value);
      readout.textContent = kind === 'day' ? dayLabel(beautyState.day) : readoutFor(key);
      handle?.setBeauty({ [key]: beautyState[key] });
      saveBeauty();
    });
  }

  // ---- 拍照 ----
  let lastTick: ForestTick | null = null;
  function takePhoto() {
    if (!handle) return;
    const url = handle.snapshot();
    const img = new Image();
    img.onload = () => {
      const cv = document.createElement('canvas');
      cv.width = img.width; cv.height = img.height;
      const g = cv.getContext('2d')!;
      g.drawImage(img, 0, 0);
      const pad = Math.round(cv.width * 0.02);
      const fs = Math.max(12, Math.round(cv.width * 0.013));
      g.font = `${fs}px "SF Mono", Menlo, Consolas, monospace`;
      g.fillStyle = 'rgba(240, 244, 240, 0.85)';
      g.textAlign = 'right';
      const lines = [`深林 · ${dayLabel(beautyState.day)}`, `秘境 ${lastTick ? lastTick.found : 0} / ${lastTick ? lastTick.total : 5}`];
      lines.forEach((ln, i) => g.fillText(ln, cv.width - pad, cv.height - pad - (lines.length - 1 - i) * Math.round(fs * 1.5)));
      const a = document.createElement('a');
      a.href = cv.toDataURL('image/png');
      a.download = `forest-${Date.now()}.png`;
      a.click();
      showToast('照片已导出');
    };
    img.src = url;
  }
  btnPhoto.addEventListener('click', takePhoto);
  addEventListener('keydown', (e) => {
    if ((e.target as HTMLElement)?.closest('button, a, input, textarea')) return;
    if (e.key.toLowerCase() === 'p' && !e.repeat) takePhoto();
  });

  // ---- HUD 回调 ----
  function onTick(t: ForestTick) {
    lastTick = t;
    const label = dayLabel(beautyState.day);
    if (hudDay.textContent !== label) hudDay.textContent = label;
    hudNear.innerHTML = t.wading ? '<b>涉水中</b> · 水声潺潺' : (t.nearFalls > 0.55 ? '靠近 <b>瀑布</b> · 水雾扑面' : (t.atWater > 0.5 ? '听见 <b>河水</b>' : '林间'));
    hudScore.innerHTML = t.found > 0 ? `秘境 <b>${t.found} / ${t.total}</b>` : `秘境 0 / ${t.total} · 藏在林深处`;
    audio.setEnv(t.atWater, t.nearFalls, t.day);
  }

  // ---- 提示文案（触屏/桌面） ----
  hudHint.innerHTML = coarse
    ? '<b>左半屏</b> 摇杆行走 · <b>右半屏</b> 拖动环顾 · <b>双指</b> 调速 · <b>双击</b> 起跳'
    : '<b>WASD</b> 行走 · <b>鼠标</b> 环顾 · <b>Shift</b> 奔跑 · <b>空格</b> 跳 · <b>H</b> 壁纸 · <b>P</b> 拍照 · 点击画面锁定鼠标';

  function webgl2OK(): boolean {
    try { return !!canvas.getContext('webgl2'); } catch { return false; }
  }

  let handle!: ReturnType<typeof createForest>;
  try {
    if (!webgl2OK()) {
      die('此浏览器不支持 WebGL2，森林无法生长。');
    } else {
      handle = createForest(canvas, {
        onTick,
        onReady: () => {
          veil.classList.add('lit');
          setTimeout(() => veil.remove(), 1400);
          setTimeout(() => hudHint.classList.add('fade'), 14000);
        },
        onDiscover: (_key, name, line) => {
          discoveryName.textContent = name;
          discoveryLine.textContent = line;
          discovery.hidden = false;
          audio.chime();
          setTimeout(() => { discovery.hidden = true; }, 7000);
        },
        onEvent: (text) => showToast(text),
      });
      // 恢复上次的画面设置（URL 的 ?day= 优先——调试与分享链接要说话算数）
      try {
        const saved = JSON.parse(localStorage.getItem(BEAUTY_STORE) || 'null') as Partial<ForestBeauty> | null;
        if (saved) Object.assign(beautyState, saved);
      } catch { /* 私隐 */ }
      const urlDay = new URLSearchParams(location.search).get('day');
      if (urlDay !== null && Number.isFinite(Number(urlDay))) beautyState.day = Number(urlDay);
      handle.setBeauty(beautyState);
      for (const [id, key, kind] of sliderMap) {
        const input = document.getElementById(id) as HTMLInputElement;
        input.value = String(beautyState[key]);
        const readout = input.parentElement!.querySelector('b')!;
        readout.textContent = kind === 'day' ? dayLabel(beautyState.day) : readoutFor(key);
      }
    }
  } catch (err) {
    die(err instanceof Error ? `${err.message}` : String(err));
  }

  addEventListener('error', (e) => {
    if (!fatal.hidden) return;
    die(e.message || '未知的故障');
  });
</script>
